6 August, 10.30am - 3.30pm, £390 for the 2 weeks (Early bird 370.50 - booked before 1st may), must book full 2 weeks // Learn Hebrew. Fast. \\r\\n\\r\\nOur popular Ulpan course is back for the summer with our expert tutors. \\r\\n\\r\\nThis ten-day intensive 40 hour course offers tuition for all levels. So whether you're a complete beginner determined to master the basics, or a confident Hebrew speaker wanting to brush up on your skills, now's your chance to learn from the best teachers around.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou might be keen to learn how to read and write Hebrew in a short space of time. Impress your relative in Israel by holding a conversation with them. Or maybe you're just tired of being taken for a ride (figuratively and literally) by over-priced Israeli taxi drivers and want to negotiate a better fare. \\r\\n\\r\\nWhatever your reason, seize the opportunity this summer and sign up for an Ulpan course you won't forget. You'll be amazed how quickly your skills improve.\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease note, this course must be booked for the full 2 weeks. Following your booking, we will be in touch to assess your level before the course begins. \",\"htmlDescription\":\"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\"duration\":300,\"imageUrl\":\"\",\"isOnSale\":true,\"name\":\"Hebrew Summer Ulpan\",\"instanceDates\":\"27 July-27 July\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"\",\"webEventId\":null,\"id\":\"613001ADHJNTHVBSHGRDQCSHVKQSMRCHK\",\"firstInstanceDateTime\":\"2026-07-27T10:30:00\",\"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\":\"2026-07-27T09:30:00Z\",\"lastInstanceDateTime\":\"2026-07-27T10:30:00\",\"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\":\"2026-07-27T09:30:00Z\",\"altText\":\"\",\"attribute_Genre\":\"Languages\",\"attribute_SeriesBooking\":\"True\",\"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\":\"Languages \",\"attribute_Language\":\"\",\"attribute_TessituraId\":\"\",\"attribute_GatedEventFree\":\"\",\"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\":\"\",\"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\":false},{\"description\":\"Mondays, 1pm - 3pm, £198, in building // \",\"html