\n        <li class=\"subshow type-info cost-message\">\n            <p>A booking fee of £2 and a security levy of £1.50 will be added to all orders. </p>\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_2\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    <div class=\"container-fluid teaserWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 60px; background: var(--background2);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"richtext\">\n            <p>Enjoy a stand-up comedy set from Rachel Creeger before this screening, as part of our Coming of Age cinema season.</p>\n        </div>\n    \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_3\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    <div class=\"container-fluid videoWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                                <aside class=\"cookieConsentPlaceholder\">\n    \n<div class=\"cookieConsentForm\" data-cookie-domain=\"jw3.org.uk\">\n    <form name=\"cookieConsentOptions\">\n        <div class=\"spinner-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"spinner\">\n\t<div class=\"rect1\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect2\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect3\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect4\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect5\"></div>\n</div>\n\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"inner\">\n            <h2>Cookies</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"content\">\n                <p>\n                                            We use services such as Youtube and Vimeo for videos and other media. To view this, you have to give permission to place cookies.\n                    \n                                            <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"#more-page_part_3\">More information&hellip;</a>\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div class=\"more\" id=\"more-page_part_3\">\n                        <h3>Functional cookies</h3> <p>These are necessary for the website to function properly. This way your basket will be remembered and you can log in on the website with your account.</p> <h3>Minimal cookies</h3> <p>This option allows cookies to enrich your experience on the website. For example, media from third parties such as videos. We also keep statistics to continuously improve the site.</p> <h3>All cookies</h3> <p>With these cookies we collect further information to carry out our marketing activities, such as newsletters and advertisements, in the most efficient and personal way.</p>\n                    </div>\n                            </div>\n            <fieldset class=\"buttons\">\n                <ul>\n                    <li>\n                        <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"default\" class=\"btn btn-reject\">\n                            Only functional cookies\n                        </button>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"limited\" class=\"btn btn-accept-limited\">\n                            Minimal cookies\n                        </button>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"all\" class=\"btn btn-accept-all\">\n                            All cookies\n                        </button>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </fieldset>\n        </div>\n    </form>\n</div>\n\n</aside>\n\n            \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_4\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n                                                                                    \n                        \n\n    \n<div class=\"container-fluid desc1Wrapper align- has-meta-info \" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"desc1\">\n                <div class=\"richtext\"><p>Shiva Baby is an anxiety-inducing dark comedy about Danielle, a directionless bisexual college student. While attending a traditional Jewish mourning reception (shiva) with her parents, her afternoon spirals into a claustrophobic nightmare when she unexpectedly runs into both her ex-girlfriend and her older, married sugar daddy who is there with his wife and baby.</p></div>\n            </div>\n        \n                    <div class=\"metaWrapper\">\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                                                                                                                                                <img class=\"poster\" src=\"https://img.jw3.org.uk/J27vxmvX2BPSpM44Akphl22vwz8tW1wJdkB9euI3bac/rs:fit:1920:800:1/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuanczLm9yZy51ay8vY21zX2ZpbGVzL3N5c3RlbS9pbWFnZXMvaW1nMDk5OV9vcmlnLmpwZw\" alt=\"Shiva Baby\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"infoList\">\n                            <dl>\n                                                                    <dt>Direction</dt>\n                                    <dd>Emma Seligman</dd>\n                                                                                                    <dt>Cast</dt>\n                                    <dd>Rachel Sennott, Danny Deferrari, Fred Melamed</dd>\n                                                                                                    <dt>Duration</dt>\n                                    <dd>117 min</dd>\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                            </dl>\n\n                            \n                        </div>\n                    \n                    \n                                            <div class=\"extraInfo\">\n                            <p>£9 / £15</p>\n                        </div>\n                    \n                                                                <div class=\"partof\">\n                                                                                        Part of<br>\n                                                        <ul>\n                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                        <a href=\"/theme/coming-of-age-film-season-bcdv\">\n                                            <span class='peppered-icon icon-arrow-right' aria-hidden='true'><svg version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink' x='0px' y='0px' width='20' height='20' viewBox='0 0 20 20' xml:space='preserve'><g transform='matrix(1,0,0,1,-220.399,9319.24)'><path style='fill: currentColor; fill-rule:nonzero;' d='M232.035,-9304.29C231.651,-9304.68 231.651,-9305.31 232.035,-9305.7L234.572,-9308.24L225.4,-9308.24C224.851,-9308.24 224.4,-9308.69 224.4,-9309.24C224.4,-9309.79 224.851,-9310.24 225.4,-9310.24L234.578,-9310.24L232.043,-9312.77C231.657,-9313.16 231.657,-9313.8 232.043,-9314.19C232.431,-9314.57 233.068,-9314.57 233.456,-9314.19L237.694,-9309.94C238.082,-9309.56 238.082,-9308.92 237.694,-9308.53L233.451,-9304.29C233.263,-9304.1 233.008,-9303.99 232.742,-9303.99C232.476,-9304 232.221,-9304.1 232.035,-9304.29Z'/></g></svg></span>\n                                            Coming of Age Film Season\n                                        </a>\n                                    </li>\n                                                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    \n\n                                        