          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"The special screening on Wednesday 15 July will be accompanied by a brand new set from JW3's beloved comedian Rachel Creeger! Exploring teenage angst, embarrassing moments and making the best of a mishegas! // Shiva Baby is an anxiety-inducing dark comedy about Danielle, a directionless bisexual college student. While attending a traditional Jewish mourning reception (shiva) with her parents, her afternoon spirals into a claustrophobic nightmare when she unexpectedly runs into both her ex-girlfriend and her older, married sugar daddy who is there with his wife and baby. // 15, 1h 7m\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 90,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Shiva Baby\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"15 July-15 July\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"627201AGTMCBNBBJLBTLSTJMDDJSKKRHT\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-15T19:00:00\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-15T18:00:00Z\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-15T19:00:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-15T18:00:00Z\",\n  \"altText\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\": true,\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"Coming of Age Film Season\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"150001AQSTDPGSPJTRGPNSVKQQSSSSNBG\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"627201AGTMCBNBBJLBTLSTJMDDJSKKRHT\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2026-07-15T19:00:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2026-07-15T18:00:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-05-19T12:43:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2026-05-19T1