          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"The love story of London-based Lebanese journalist and Syrian-based activist/cameraman over thirteen years of revolutions, war and exile. From besieged Aleppo to the confines of a London newsroom, Lebanese journalist Janay Boulos and Syrian activist /cameraman Abd Alkader Habak retrace their love story, using their vast personal archives stretching over 13 years of revolutions, war and exile. Can their love survive distance, danger, and differences? Duration: 85 minutes Rating: TBC Director: Janay Boulos, Abd Alkader Habak Year: 2026 Language: Arabic and English Subtitles: English https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NUR79tVVOv0\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 85,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Birds of War\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"20 July-23 July\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"641601ADJGDKTSNNVGGTCSQMSCDLKGJDH\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-20T14:00:00\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-20T13:00:00Z\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-23T15:40:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-23T14:40:00Z\",\n  \"altText\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\": false,\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"4401APLLPBSHLDJVTLGBDQTQBHJDJSHCM\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"641601ADJGDKTSNNVGGTCSQMSCDLKGJDH\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2026-07-20T14:00:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2026-07-20T13:00:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-06-25T11:16:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebU