            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"Set on Vancouver Island in the late 1990s, Blue Heron follows eight-year-old Sasha and her Hungarian immigrant family as they attempt to build a new life, only to be destabilised by the increasingly dangerous behaviour of her older brother, Jeremy. Drawing on her own memories, filmmaker Sophy Romvari shapes a deeply personal portrait of childhood, family fractures, and the fragility of recollection. Duration: 90 minutes Rating: 12A Director: Sophy Romvari Cast: Eylul Guven, Edik Beddoes, Iringó Réti Year: 2026 Language: English and Hungairan Subtitles: English https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6qAK9GwWRe0\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 91,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Blue Heron\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"24 July-31 July\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"641202ADTMRPSPRQVDMKSQCKGSMRQTHJT\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-24T13:15:00\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-24T12:15:00Z\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-31T13:00:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-31T12:00:00Z\",\n  \"altText\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\": false,\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"4401APLLPBSHLDJVTLGBDQTQBHJDJSHCM\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"641202ADTMRPSPRQVDMKSQCKGSMRQTHJT\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2026-07-24T13:15:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2026-07-24T12:15:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-06-25T11:18:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2026-06-25T10:1