            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"Featuring a César-winning performance from Théodore Pellerin, Nino is the heartwarming and celebratory story of a young man traversing the streets of Paris as he reconnects with friends, family, and himself after a life-altering diagnosis. Duration: 96 minutes Rating: 15 Director: Pauline Loquès Cast: Théodore Pellerin, William Lebghil, Salomé Dewaels Year: 2025 Language: French Subtitles: English https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wGGFce0vQoc\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 91,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Nino\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"24 July-30 July\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"641402AHMBDVMGRBLSVJTJJLKRSRCKRPL\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-24T15:30:00\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-24T14:30:00Z\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-30T13:30:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-30T12:30:00Z\",\n  \"altText\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\": false,\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"4401APLLPBSHLDJVTLGBDQTQBHJDJSHCM\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"641402AHMBDVMGRBLSVJTJJLKRSRCKRPL\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2026-07-24T15:30:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2026-07-24T14:30:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-06-25T11:39:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2026-06-25T10:39:00Z\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-07-24T15:30:00\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2026-07-24T14:30:00Z\",\n      \"webInstanceId\": null,\n      \"cancelled\