ass='label'><span class='label'><span class=\"movie-time-start\">6:00 PM</span><span class='screenreader'>Tickets</span></span></span>\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n</li>\n\n        \n        \n                    <li class=\"subshow type-info cost-message\">\n                <p>A booking fee of £2 and a security levy of £1.50 will be added to all orders. </p>\n            </li>\n        \n                    </ul>\n\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_2\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    <div class=\"container-fluid teaserWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 60px; background: var(--background2);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"richtext\">\n            <p>Marc Isaacs makes a deal with The Synthetic Sincerity Lab, an AI research project.</p>\n        </div>\n    \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_3\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    <div class=\"container-fluid videoWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                                <aside class=\"cookieConsentPlaceholder\">\n    \n<div class=\"cookieConsentForm\" data-cookie-domain=\"jw3.org.uk\">\n    <form name=\"cookieConsentOptions\">\n        <div class=\"spinner-wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"spinner\">\n\t<div class=\"rect1\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect2\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect3\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect4\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect5\"></div>\n</div>\n\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"inner\">\n            <h2>Cookies</h2>\n\n            <div class=\"content\">\n                <p>\n                                            We use services such as Youtube and Vimeo for videos and other media. To view this, you have to give permission to place cookies.\n                    \n                                            <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"#more-page_part_3\">More information&hellip;</a>\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div class=\"more\" id=\"more-page_part_3\">\n                        <h3>Functional cookies</h3> <p>These are necessary for the website to function properly. This way your basket will be remembered and you can log in on the website with your account.</p> <h3>Minimal cookies</h3> <p>This option allows cookies to enrich your experience on the website. For example, media from third parties such as videos. We also keep statistics to continuously improve the site.</p> <h3>All cookies</h3> <p>With these cookies we collect further information to carry out our marketing activities, such as newsletters and advertisements, in the most efficient and personal way.</p>\n                    </div>\n                            </div>\n            <fieldset class=\"buttons\">\n                <ul>\n                    <li>\n                        <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"default\" class=\"btn btn-reject\">\n                            Only functional cookies\n                        </button>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"limited\" class=\"btn btn-accept-limited\">\n                            Minimal cookies\n                        </button>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"all\" class=\"btn btn-accept-all\">\n                            All cookies\n                        </button>\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </fieldset>\n        </div>\n    </form>\n</div>\n\n</aside>\n\n            \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_4\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n                                            \n                        \n\n    \n<div class=\"container-fluid desc1Wrapper align- has-meta-info \" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"desc1\">\n                <div class=\"richtext\"><p>Marc Isaacs makes a deal with The Synthetic Sincerity Lab, an AI research project. There, researchers are investigating the possibility of teaching AI characters authenticity, using characters from Isaacs’ documentaries to do so. In return, they allow Isaacs to film the process.</p></div>\n            </div>\n        \n                    <div class=\"metaWrapper\">\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                                                                                                                                                <img class=\"poster\" src=\"https://img.jw3.org.uk/1X0pAC457DXgNKCHTWfdhGO9QuGZ3LE8uKmnFQU0z6A/rs:fit:1920:800:1/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuanczLm9yZy51ay8vY21zX2ZpbGVzL3N5c3RlbS9pbWFnZXMvaW1nMTAwMV9vcmlnLmpwZw\" alt=\"Synthetic Sincerity\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"infoList\">\n                            <dl>\n                                                                    <dt>Direction</dt>\n                                    <dd>Marc Isaacs</dd>\n                                                                                                                                    <dt>Duration</dt>\n                                    <dd>72 min</dd>\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                            </dl>\n\n                            \n                        </div>\n                    \n                    \n                                            <div class=\"extraInfo\">\n                            <p>£9 / £15</p>\n                        </div>\n                    \n                                        \n\n                                        \n\n                                                        </div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_161\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_7\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_5\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    \n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_90\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_9\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_226\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_227\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_10\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_8\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_223\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    \n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_114\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    \n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_11\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    \n\n    <aside class=\"section section--suggestions container-fluid suggestionWrapper  variant-boxed arrows\" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n        <div id=\"suggestionHeader\" class=\"section__header\">\n            <h2 class=\"section__title\">Others also viewed</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"inner section__inner\">\n\n            <div  class=\"carousel carousel--suggestions\" data-carousel-id-value=\"page_part_11\" data-part-id=\"page_part_11\" data-carousel-centered-value=\"false\" data-carousel-number-visible-value=\"1\" data-lightbox-allow-lightbox-value=\"false\" data-carousel-round-arrows-value=\"true\" data-carousel-loop-value=\"