          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"For the special screening on Sunday 26th July, we invite you to a conversational cinema experience, sharing your stories from your second chapter. Have you started something new later in life? Changed direction? Followed a long-held dream? Reinvented yourself? We'd love to hear your second-chapter stories, to be shared pre- and post- screening, alongside a social in our Cafe afterwards. // A cantor in a crisis of faith finds his world turned upside down when his grade school music teacher re-enters his life as his new adult Bat Mitzvah student. // 15, 1h 51m\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 180,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Between the Temples\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"26 July-30 July\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"627401AKDKLCTPNDKGNGCLDSVDSJRVRGH\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-26T18:00:00\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-26T17:00:00Z\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-30T17:30:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-30T16:30:00Z\",\n  \"altText\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\": true,\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"Coming of Age Film Season\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"3407AVKPCVQSLVLLJHSHRNQMDJSNQJQVL\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"150001AQSTDPGSPJTRGPNSVKQQSSSSNBG\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"627401AKDKLCTPNDKGNGCLDSVDSJRVRGH\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2026-07-26T18:00:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2026-07-26T17:00:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-05-19T12:51:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2026-05-19T11:51:00Z\",\n  