          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"Surviving bar-to-bar on anecdotes and the ‘good old days’, two blustery 50-somethings hatch a plan to change their luck by digging up the cash their old pal buried before he left for Argentina. En route to the airport, they come across a shy architecture student whose view of life will transform as they take him under their wing on a road trip across the Venetian plains. Duration: 100 minutes Rating: 15 Director: Francesco Sossai Cast: Filippo Scotti, Sergio Romano, Pierpaolo Capovilla Year: 2025 Language: Italian Subtitles: English https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=970EvAbQ3qI\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 101,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"The Last One for the Road\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"31 July-31 July\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"640802AHRLGHVNCHBHTPDGMLQHVRSPTCL\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-31T15:00:00\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-31T14:00:00Z\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-31T15:00:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-31T14:00:00Z\",\n  \"altText\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\": false,\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"4401APLLPBSHLDJVTLGBDQTQBHJDJSHCM\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"640802AHRLGHVNCHBHTPDGMLQHVRSPTCL\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2026-07-31T15:00:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2026-07-31T14:00:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-06-25T11:49:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2026-06-25T10:49:00Z\",\n  